Eligible students must reside in rural areas outside Pune city and must be enrolled in full-time courses in engineering, medical, science and agriculture, arts, commerce, and other disciplines at colleges within the Pune Municipal Corporation limits.
The admission process is based on a merit list, which is prepared considering the marks obtained in the last qualifying examination.
